      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Duke%2C_Missouri"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "It lies on Missouri Route K, just two miles east of a winding bend in the Big Piney River.",
